# Code owners for ESI.ts.
#
# Owners are requested for review automatically. Ownership only blocks a
# merge when branch protection on master has "Require review from Code
# Owners" enabled.
#
# The last matching pattern wins, so the explicit entries below take
# precedence over the catch-all. They name the files automation rewrites
# (Dependabot, release-please) and the files that control CI and supply
# chain, so those keep a named owner even if the catch-all is narrowed later.

* @lgriffin

# Dependency manifests: Dependabot opens PRs against these.
/package.json @lgriffin
/package-lock.json @lgriffin

# CI, Dependabot configuration, and this file.
/.github/ @lgriffin
/.zizmor.yml @lgriffin

# Release automation: release-please rewrites these on every release PR.
/release-please-config.json @lgriffin
/.release-please-manifest.json @lgriffin
